# AGENTS.md

This file tells you how to work in this project. Fill in each section as the project evolves.

## Where to look

- What the project is, what it deliberately is not, and its domain vocabulary: `CONTEXT.md`. Read it before work that touches domain concepts and use its terms exactly; new terms go in through `/grill-with-docs`.
- Hard-to-reverse decisions: `docs/ADRs/` (it appears with the first one). Read only the ones for the area you are changing, they might be extensive.
- Architecture and project structure: `README.md`.
- Stack and dependencies: `{{ py_root }}pyproject.toml` and `.pre-commit-config.yaml`.
